DW1e -- M200c: the framework's PLATEAU against the paper's extrapolated virial mass
==================================================================================================================
  DESI joint M200c = 1.19 +- 0.13 e12 Msun.  The paper reports NO enclosed mass beyond 80 kpc and
  draws the beyond-80-kpc curve only for illustration, as NFW with c200c = 12.  The framework has no virial
  mass at all: the phantom mass SATURATES at nu(e_N) M_b once the external field takes over (item 38).
